<title>USA: Ford Motor Co Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Co Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>DEARBORN, Mich. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.22		    $0.54</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.20		    $0.53</p>
<p> Net		    1,469,000		  653,000</p>
